### Replace with a real user id from Supabase → Authentication → Users
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Search ingredients (run this first — no user needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ingredients/search?q=ban

### List pantry items for a user (empty at first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pantry/items?user_id={{userId}}

### Add an item to the pantry
# Copy an ingredient "id" from the search response above into ingredient_id below
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pantry/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{userId}}",
  "ingredient_id": "PASTE_INGREDIENT_ID_HERE",
  "quantity": 6,
  "unit": "each",
  "storage_location": "pantry"
}

### List pantry items again (should now show the item you added)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pantry/items?user_id={{userId}}

### Delete a pantry item
# Copy an item "id" from the list response above
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/pantry/items/PASTE_ITEM_ID_HERE?user_id={{userId}}
